### Setup !!!
#
# REST Client extension (Huachao Mao) for VS code is needed
#

### Variables
# In DEV_MODE the auth header is ignored, so leave @token empty.
# For Firebase auth, paste an ID token (e.g. from the frontend) into @token.

@base  = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@token =

### Get job by id — paste the job_id returned above
@jobId = 8a6d927a-b3d8-4811-b354-6d6cc2235060
GET {{base}}/jobs/{{jobId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
